Hi All,


I'm happy to announce that my paper "Near real time weather and ocean model data access with rNOMADS" was recently accepted by the journal Computers & Geosciences, and it is now available for download for free here:

http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S009830041500045X


Please cite this paper if you use rNOMADS in your research!  Thanks!

